      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "37002",
      "subQuestName": "Listen to Jean's conversation with the strange person",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3700201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3700201": {
            "id": "3700201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Isn't that Jean?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700202"
            ]
          },
          "3700202": {
            "id": "3700202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Seems she's talking to someone...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700203"
            ]
          },
          "3700203": {
            "id": "3700203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's let her finish, then go say hi?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700204"
            ]
          },
          "3700204": {
            "id": "3700204",
            "speakerId": 1487,
            "speakerName": "Anastasia",
            "text": "...which is what has brought us to this point in the first place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700205"
            ]
          },
          "3700205": {
            "id": "3700205",
            "speakerId": 1487,
            "speakerName": "Anastasia",
            "text": "If you are unable to promptly deal with the Stormterror threat, then leave the defense of Mondstadt to the Fatui.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700206"
            ]
          },
          "3700206": {
            "id": "3700206",
            "speakerId": 1487,
            "speakerName": "Anastasia",
            "text": "We can put an end to Mondstadt's dragon issues. All we need to do is bring that monster to the—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700207"
            ]
          },
          "3700207": {
            "id": "3700207",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "\"Monster\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700208"
            ]
          },
          "3700208": {
            "id": "3700208",
            "speakerId": 1487,
            "speakerName": "Anastasia",
            "text": "Yes. What's your point?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700209"
            ]
          },
          "3700209": {
            "id": "3700209",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Ah...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700210"
            ]
          },
          "3700210": {
            "id": "3700210",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "I'd expect a more professional attitude from your diplomats.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700211"
            ]
          },
          "3700211": {
            "id": "3700211",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Yet here you are saying you want to \"put an end\" to one of The Four Winds of Mondstadt?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700212"
            ]
          },
          "3700212": {
            "id": "3700212",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "I won't have any of this nonsense in front of the Knights of Favonius.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700213"
            ]
          },
          "3700213": {
            "id": "3700213",
            "speakerId": 1487,
            "speakerName": "Anastasia",
            "text": "Heh... Hehehe... It's not as crazy as you make it sound.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700214"
            ]
          },
          "3700214": {
            "id": "3700214",
            "speakerId": 1487,
            "speakerName": "Anastasia",
            "text": "Fine. That's enough negotiation for today.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700215"
            ]
          },
          "3700215": {
            "id": "3700215",
            "speakerId": 1487,
            "speakerName": "Anastasia",
            "text": "At this stage it's simply... an amicable exchange of constructive opinions, no?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700216"
            ]
          },
          "3700216": {
            "id": "3700216",
            "speakerId": 1487,
            "speakerName": "Anastasia",
            "text": "I'll be sure to make... thorough notes...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700217"
            ]
          },
          "3700217": {
            "id": "3700217",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "#Oh, {NICKNAME}, you're back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700218"
            ]
          },
          "3700218": {
            "id": "3700218",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Thanks for your help. The elemental flow is finally stable.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700219"
            ]
          },
          "3700219": {
            "id": "3700219",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "The aftermath of Stormterror's last attack is finally settled for the moment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700220"
            ]
          },
          "3700220": {
            "id": "3700220",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "However, the pressure from the delegation has become too big to be ignored...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700221"
            ]
          },
          "3700221": {
            "id": "3700221",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Delegation?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700222"
            ]
          },
          "3700222": {
            "id": "3700222",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "From Liyue Harbor or Inazuma City?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700223"
            ]
          },
          "3700223": {
            "id": "3700223",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Snezhnaya. They choose to follow the God of Cryo.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700224"
            ]
          },
          "3700224": {
            "id": "3700224",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Their envoys go by a particular name: The Fatui. Heard of them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700225"
            ]
          },
          "3700225": {
            "id": "3700225",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, them. They are super famous.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700226"
            ]
          },
          "3700226": {
            "id": "3700226",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, infamous is more the word...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700227"
            ]
          },
          "3700227": {
            "id": "3700227",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "I don't think killing Stormterror is the right course of action.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700228"
            ]
          },
          "3700228": {
            "id": "3700228",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "The Cryo God's Fatui have always coveted the Anemo God's power.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700229"
            ]
          },
          "3700229": {
            "id": "3700229",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "I don't believe they have Mondstadt's best interests at heart.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700230"
            ]
          },
          "3700230": {
            "id": "3700230",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Speaking of power...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700231"
            ]
          },
          "3700231": {
            "id": "3700231",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "#What is it, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700232"
            ]
          },
          "3700232": {
            "id": "3700232",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "There's something I need to show the Knights of Favonius.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700233"
            ]
          },
          "3700233": {
            "id": "3700233",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Oh? Let us head back to headquarters then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700234"
            ]
          },
          "3700234": {
            "id": "3700234",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "We shouldn't discuss important matters... out in the open."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "37004",
      "subQuestName": "Return to the Knights of Favonius Headquarters with Jean",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3700401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3700401": {
            "id": "3700401",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "It's a crystal embedded with some kind of power... Lisa, are you able to analyze it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700402"
            ]
          },
          "3700402": {
            "id": "3700402",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Let me take a look...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700403"
            ]
          },
          "3700403": {
            "id": "3700403",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Hmm... I can see impurities in the crystal, but upon further inspection...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700404"
            ]
          },
          "3700404": {
            "id": "3700404",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "No, I'm sorry, I can't make a proper analysis at the moment. Give me some time. I'll take a look through the library's restricted section.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700405"
            ]
          },
          "3700405": {
            "id": "3700405",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Right. I'll leave the research to you then, Lisa.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700406"
            ]
          },
          "3700406": {
            "id": "3700406",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Understood. I'll notify you all if I make any progress.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700407"
            ]
          },
          "3700407": {
            "id": "3700407",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Though I wouldn't go getting your hopes up. They are incredibly ancient texts, not to mentio— Ouch!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700408"
            ]
          },
          "3700408": {
            "id": "3700408",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Gosh, that hurt!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700409"
            ]
          },
          "3700409": {
            "id": "3700409",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "The impurities in the crystal... It hurts when I get close...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700410"
            ]
          },
          "3700410": {
            "id": "3700410",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "I see... It appears to react to Visions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700411"
            ]
          },
          "3700411": {
            "id": "3700411",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "The impurities and the elemental energy we embody repel each other.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700412"
            ]
          },
          "3700412": {
            "id": "3700412",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "#It's strange, though. {NICKNAME} has elemental abilities as well, but doesn't seem to be affected in the same way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700413"
            ]
          },
          "3700413": {
            "id": "3700413",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700414"
            ]
          },
          "3700414": {
            "id": "3700414",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Anyway, the crystal would be better left in the hands of my cutie. It will just be a pain if left with us — both literally and metaphorically.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700417"
            ]
          },
          "3700417": {
            "id": "3700417",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "...Fascinating.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700418"
            ]
          },
          "3700418": {
            "id": "3700418",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Do you know anything about what makes you special?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700419"
            ]
          },
          "3700419": {
            "id": "3700419",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...*shakes head*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700420"
            ]
          },
          "3700420": {
            "id": "3700420",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "I do not know what to make of it either.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700421"
            ]
          },
          "3700421": {
            "id": "3700421",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "#Well, then, {NICKNAME}... The Knights of Favonius have another favor to ask of you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700422"
            ]
          },
          "3700422": {
            "id": "3700422",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Please accept the title of Honorary Knight... and the gratitude of the Acting Grand Master.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700423"
            ]
          },
          "3700423": {
            "id": "3700423",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...*mildly surprised*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700424"
            ]
          },
          "3700424": {
            "id": "3700424",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Honorary Knight... of Favonius!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700425"
            ]
          },
          "3700425": {
            "id": "3700425",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "...*nods*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700426"
            ]
          },
          "3700426": {
            "id": "3700426",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "We ask for your continued assistance in finding some answers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700427"
            ]
          },
          "3700427": {
            "id": "3700427",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Stormterror's rage... and strange crystals... I know Mondstadt's peace hangs in the balance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700428"
            ]
          },
          "3700428": {
            "id": "3700428",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "May the wind open your eyes to the truth.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700429"
            ]
          },
          "3700429": {
            "id": "3700429",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "We'll meet back here if you find anything."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "37005",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Jean",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "37003",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3700301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3700301": {
            "id": "3700301",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Mondstadt and Snezhnaya are considered the same in status.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700302"
            ]
          },
          "3700302": {
            "id": "3700302",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Mondstadt is independent, and does not belong to any other nation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700303"
            ]
          },
          "3700303": {
            "id": "3700303",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "In fact, despite being referred to as a city, Mondstadt is a nation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700304"
            ]
          },
          "3700304": {
            "id": "3700304",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Though, Snezhnaya's Fatui are known to be the most aggressive diplomats in Teyvat...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3700305"
            ]
          },
          "3700305": {
            "id": "3700305",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Makes sense, given the tone of that woman just now — so rude!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "48202",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "4820221"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "4820221": {
            "id": "4820221",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Okay then. You just need to follow the <color=#00E1FFFF>marked route</color> to the finish."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}